sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer (SPA)
  participant G as gateway
  participant O as ordering-api
  participant S as Stripe
  participant Q as Service Bus
  participant E as enrollment-api
  C->>G: POST /orders/checkout {programId}
  G->>O: forward (+ user id)
  O->>O: create Order (Pending, TenantId, CustomerId)
  O->>S: Checkout Session (destination charge, application fee)
  O-->>C: redirect URL
  C->>S: pays on Stripe-hosted page
  S->>G: webhook checkout.session.completed
  G->>O: forward
  O->>O: verify signature, dedupe, Order = Paid + outbox row (one transaction)
  O->>Q: outbox publisher sends OrderPaid
  Q->>E: OrderPaid (scales enrollment-api up from zero)
  E->>E: create Enrollment (idempotent on OrderId)
  C->>G: GET /me/programs
